                                                "sense_id": "69e79c7c-489a-3433-adc9-bf47fe5ae4c4",
                                                "text": "Every day the stock market is pushed higher by the Fed, it becomes more dislocated from reality. The homebuilder stocks are more dislocated from fundamental reality now than they were at the peak of the bubble."
